%% HTTP prefix: /api/v1. API lane includes verified middleware and errorHandler.
%% Grouped read and validation calls short-circuit on error. No Repository layer is implied.
%% Cross-store identity synchronization is not a distributed transaction. SQL rollback cannot undo every earlier Mongo mutation.
%% Manager operational staff assignment is separate from Admin global role management.
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Admin
    participant UI as ResourcePage / AdminFacilities
    participant API as Express middleware / errorHandler
    participant C as usersController
    participant S as usersService
    participant DB as Mongo models / Prisma

    A->>UI: Change user role or active state
    UI->>API: PATCH /api/v1/users/:id
    activate API
    API->>API: authenticate, authorize(ADMIN), validate request
    alt request guard rejects
        API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403 error
    else request accepted
        API->>C: updateUser(req, res, next)
        activate C
        C->>S: updateUser(id, data, requesterId)
        activate S
        S->>DB: Lock identity in wrapper, read Mongo and global PostgreSQL projection
        activate DB
        DB-->>S: Requested records and validation context
        deactivate DB
        S->>S: Protect own role and account, last Admin / Manager, active member rights and future Coach assignments
        alt protected identity or incompatible existing business relations
            S->>DB: Roll back PostgreSQL transaction, Mongo writes cannot roll back with it
            S-->>C: 400 / 404 / 409
        else business conditions satisfied
            S->>DB: Update identity and role profiles, synchronize projection and revoke obsolete sessions as implemented
            activate DB
            DB-->>S: Saved result
            deactivate DB
            S->>DB: Commit PostgreSQL transaction
            S-->>C: Updated account
        end
        deactivate S
        C-->>API: response or next(error)
        deactivate C
        API-->>UI: 200 result or mapped error
    end
    deactivate API
    UI-->>A: Show result or actionable error
%% PostgreSQL delegates reuse the ambient transaction. MongoDB and socket side effects are separate.

